<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>io.github.thornbux.Glimt</id>
  <name>Glimt</name>
  <summary>A fast, memory-frugal image viewer</summary>
  <metadata_license>MIT</metadata_license>
  <project_license>MIT</project_license>
  <developer id="io.github.thornbux">
    <name>Hans-Henry Jakobsen</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      Glimt shows images quickly, in folders of any size, from a few images to several hundred
      thousand. It is inspired by Geeqie and follows its keyboard shortcuts.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>JPEG, PNG, WebP, GIF, TIFF, SVG, camera RAW, HEIC, AVIF and JPEG XL</li>
      <li>Thumbnails, several images at once, comparing, a slideshow and full screen</li>
      <li>Marks, stars, keywords and collections; Find Duplicates and Rename Many</li>
      <li>Colour management, EXIF, a histogram, and a Pan view by date</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">glimt.desktop</launchable>
